    <string name="about_link_telegram_summary">Subscribe to our channel</string>
    <string name="about_acknowledgments_title">Special thanks (unordered)</string>
    <string name="about_ack_rovo89_summary">Founder of the Xposed Framework; the originator and pioneer of the entire modular ecosystem.</string>
    <string name="about_ack_lsposed_team_summary">With thanks to the LSPosed Team for their continuous contributions to the Xposed ecosystem and low-level injection techniques.</string>
    <string name="about_ack_jingmatrix_summary">Author of Vector, whose outstanding framework architecture provided a vital foundation and inspiration for NPatch.</string>
    <string name="about_ack_lspatch_summary">A pioneer in rootless patching solutions, proving the feasibility of dynamic Xposed environment loading via manager-side implementation.</string>
    <string name="about_ack_libxposed_summary">The driving force behind Xposed API standardisation, bringing type safety and clear conventions to the module development world.</string>
    <string name="about_ack_winter_summary">My very first financial supporter; thank you for such early and direct encouragement.</string>
    <string name="about_ack_m558_summary">The one who keeps the gears turning behind the scenes — thank you for the quiet but indispensable support.</string>
    <string name="about_ack_community_summary">Thanks to all users involved in testing, submitting PRs, and reporting issues to drive the project forward together.</string>

